---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Keep this date current whenever the substance of the terms changes.
const lastUpdated = 'August 31, 2026';
const contactEmail = 'alex@ka-performancefl.com';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | K & A Performance"
  description="The terms for using ka-performancefl.com, our services, and our SMS text message program, including opt-in, opt-out, message frequency, and rates."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-16 md:pt-48">
    <p data-animate="type-settle" class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">
      Legal
    </p>
    <h1 data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.1" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.02]">
      Terms &amp; Conditions
    </h1>
    <p data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.2" class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
      Last updated {lastUpdated}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-32 md:pb-40">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          These terms cover your use of <strong class="text-ink">ka-performancefl.com</strong> and
          the messages we send you, including text messages. K &amp; A Performance is a web design
          and AI integration studio operating in Florida. If you use this site, contact us through
          it, or opt in to our text messages, these terms apply. If you do not agree with them,
          please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Using this site</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You may browse the site, read our work, and contact us about a project. Please do not
          attempt to break, scrape at scale, overload, or gain unauthorised access to any part of
          it, and do not submit anything unlawful through our forms or chat. We may change, pause,
          or remove parts of the site at any time without notice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Enquiries, quotes, and engagements</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Scoping conversations, estimates, and quotes are free and are not binding offers. Nothing
          on this site and no reply to a form submission creates a contract on its own. Paid work
          begins only under a separate written proposal or engagement agreement signed by both of
          us, and that agreement governs the project, deliverables, timelines, fees, and ownership.
          Where these terms and a signed engagement agreement conflict, the engagement agreement
          wins for that project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">The AI assistant</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Some pages offer an AI assistant that answers questions and helps scope a project. It is a
          convenience, not advice, and it can be wrong. Nothing it says is a quote, a commitment, or
          a professional recommendation, and we are not bound by it. Please do not type passwords,
          payment details, or confidential material into it. How those messages are handled is
          described in our
          <a href="/privacy/" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="sms" class="scroll-mt-28">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Text message (SMS) terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          K &amp; A Performance runs a text messaging program so we can reach you about your enquiry
          or your project. These terms apply to that program, and by opting in you agree to them.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">What we send</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Customer care messages only: appointment and consultation scheduling, confirmations,
          reschedules and reminders, replies to an enquiry you sent us, project updates, and invoice
          or billing notices. We do not send marketing or promotional text messages, and we do not
          send recurring campaign blasts.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Scheduling messages are handled by an automated assistant that books, confirms, and
          reminds you about appointments, so some replies you receive are generated automatically
          rather than typed by a person. You can always reach a human by emailing
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">How you opt in</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You opt in by giving us your mobile number and asking us in writing to text you. We do not
          collect mobile numbers or SMS consent through the forms on this site, so you will never be
          texted because of something you filled in here. Consent to receive text messages is not a
          condition of purchasing anything from us, and you are welcome to work with us by email or
          phone alone.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">Message frequency</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Message frequency varies. It depends on your enquiry and on whether a project is active,
          and messages are generally sent in reply to something you asked or in response to a
          scheduled milestone.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">Cost</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Message and data rates may apply. We do not charge you for text messages, but your mobile
          carrier may charge you for sending or receiving them under your plan. Check with your
          carrier if you are unsure.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">How to stop (opt out)</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Reply <strong class="text-ink">STOP</strong> to any message from us at any time to cancel.
          You will receive one final message confirming that you have been unsubscribed, and we will
          send no further texts to that number. You can also email
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">{contactEmail}</a>
          and ask us to remove your number. Opting out of texts does not stop us replying to you by
          email.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">How to get help</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Reply <strong class="text-ink">HELP</strong> to any message from us for assistance, or
          email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">{contactEmail}</a>.
          We will reply with our contact details and how to opt out.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">Carriers and delivery</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery depends on effective
          transmission by your mobile carrier and is outside our control, so please do not rely on
          text messages for anything time-critical. Supported carriers may change without notice.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">Your number</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Only give us a mobile number you own or are authorised to use, and tell us if it changes
          or you give it up, so we do not end up texting someone who never asked to hear from us.
          You must be at least 18 years old to opt in.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg text-ink">Privacy</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Your mobile number and your consent to be texted are handled as described in our
          <a href="/privacy/" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Privacy Policy</a>.
          We do not sell mobile numbers. No mobile information will be shared with third parties or
          affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data
          and consent will not be shared with any third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Our work and yours</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          The design, copy, code, and imagery on this site belong to K &amp; A Performance or to the
          clients and artists we credit, and are protected by copyright. Please do not copy or
          republish them without permission. Anything you send us through a form or the chat stays
          yours; you give us permission to use it to reply to you and to scope the work you asked
          about.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Third-party services and links</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site links to other sites and relies on third-party services for forms, hosting,
          messaging, and AI. We do not control those services and are not responsible for their
          content or their practices. Their own terms and privacy policies apply when you use them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Disclaimers and limits</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site and its content are provided as-is, without warranties of any kind, express or
          implied. We do not promise the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or fit for a
          particular purpose. To the fullest extent the law allows, K &amp; A Performance is not
          liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this
          site, our AI assistant, or our text messages. Nothing here limits liability that cannot
          lawfully be limited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Governing law</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to its
          conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute arising from them belongs in the state or federal
          courts serving Alachua County, Florida.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Changes and contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          If these terms change in substance, we will update the date at the top of this page.
          Continuing to use the site or our text messages after a change means you accept the
          updated terms. Questions about any of it can go to
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
